OL,3,GNEWSAHow to plan around the A11
OL,4,AThickthorn closures
OL,5,
OL,6,FDrivers are likely to face disruption
OL,7,Fduring a weekend of road closure while
OL,8,Fengineers connect up and install a new
OL,9,Fbridge.
OL,11,FThe modular bridge is part of a
OL,12,Fredesign of the A11/A47 Thickthorn
OL,13,Fjunction, near Norwich, with the A11
OL,14,Fshut in both directions between the
OL,15,Fjunction and Wymondham from 20:00 BST
OL,16,Fon Friday.
OL,18,FDiversion routes will be in place for
OL,19,Fthe duration until 06:00 BST on Monday.
OL,20,FThe route is shutting to allow for the
OL,21,Finstallation over the road as part of
OL,22,Fthe #200m improvement scheme.
OL,23,APub: 18-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
